t and sound design for the Halo trilogy.","extract_html":"<p><b>Martin O'Donnell</b> is an American composer, audio director, and sound designer best known for his work on video game developer Bungie's titles, including the <span><i>Myth</i> series</span>, <i>Oni</i>, the <span><i>Halo</i> series</span>, and <i>Destiny</i>. O'Donnell collaborated with Michael Salvatori for all of the scores; he has also directed voice talent and sound design for the <i>Halo</i> trilogy.</p>"}